///
/// For `iN`, the upper bound is MIN * MIN + MAX + MAX => 2²ⁿ⁻² + 2ⁿ - 2,
/// and the lower bound is MAX * MIN + MIN + MIN => -2²ⁿ⁻² - 2ⁿ + 2ⁿ⁺¹.
