/// `for` loop directly. This won't compile:
///
/// ```compile_fail,E0277
/// // error[E0277]: the trait bound `std::ops::RangeToInclusive<{integer}>:
/// // std::iter::Iterator` is not satisfied
/// for i in ..=5 {
///     // ...
/// }
/// ```
