    /// Splits the slice into a slice of `N`-element arrays,
    /// assuming that there's no remainder.
    ///
    /// This is the inverse operation to [`as_flattened_mut`].
    ///
    /// [`as_flattened_mut`]: slice::as_flattened_mut
    ///
